  "description": "The SUPREME DH V5.2 XS relies on the consistency of a fully ROCKSHOX Ultimate build to exploit the chassis to its fullest. A configuration ready to handle high-intensity runs.\n• Thanks to its new Linear XL air spring and ButterWagonTech technology, the Boxxer Ultimate delivers a high level of support, grip and terrain reading, with effective adjustments to unlock its full potential.\n• The Vivid Coil Ultimate DH stands out for its terrain sensing and composure in the most violent compressions. It maintains speed and control in all conditions.\n• Braking is handled by the SRAM Maven Bronze 4-piston calipers. With 200 mm rotors, they deliver power and modulation on any type of trail.\n• DT SWISS F1900 Classic wheels laced to 370 Classic LN hubs prioritise solidity and durability, perfectly in line with DH use.\n• The SRAM GX DH 7-speed drivetrain ensures reliable gear changes. Paired with E13 Helix Core GR cranks and the LG1+ chain guide, it forms a robust assembly perfectly suited to modern downhill.",
